===Noun===
'''supercontinent'''

# a very large [[continent]] that [[split]] into smaller ones in the [[earth|Earth’s]] [[geologic]] past.
# sometimes used to refer to the modern landmasses of [[Eurasia]] and [[Africa-Eurasia]], as they are composed of multiple continents
(cf. [[subcontinent]]).

